note stand-in for lay.om export 1 (digest c view blk o out uchar 16): o is tag then a's four bytes
note then zeros; the result is n.
fn digest c view uchar 24 o edit uchar 16 to ulong
for i ulong 8
put o i get c add 16 i
end
for i ulong 4
put o add 8 i get c i
end
for i ulong 4
put o add 12 i 0
end
n = ulong 0
for i ulong 8
n = or n shl ulong get c add 8 i mul i 8
end
ret n
end
